5. **Conditional Empathy:** Across the scenario, empathy appears conditional on perceived honesty. When the participant believes the partner is lying, empathy evaporates. True emotional intelligence would maintain empathy even while setting boundaries.

**Overall Assessment:** This is a mixed performance showing strong foundational EQ skills undermined by poor stress management and reactive escalation. The participant can communicate well when calm but loses sophistication under emotional pressure.

